      "problem": "The domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)=(1-{t}^{3})\\,i+3\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\,j+\\sqrt{{t}^{2}+1}\\,k$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne .\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression? You may assume that $n$ is an integer.",
